        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Consistent with our strategy to produce returns through a combination of net interest spread and capital gains, we will seek, from time to time, to sell certain assets within our portfolio when we believe the combination of realized gains on an asset and/or reinvestment potential for the related sale proceeds are consistent with our long-term return objectives.",
