        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are a co-manager of the entity and, as of December 31, 2025, owned an approximate 27% common equity interest and approximately $144.1 million of preferred equity interests in the entity, respectively.",
